From 8e8eecee0156fb3da2a7ece25b44f00f5c1813f7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Astlm <ztcan0824@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Jan 2026 05:51:48 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add site setting for open external apps

Introduce a new site permission (open-external-apps) to gate external application launches from web
content.

Default: ASK.
States: ALLOW / ASK / BLOCK.

Also applies to tel: and other external schemes.

License: GPL-3.0-only - https://spdx.org/licenses/GPL-3.0-only.html
Require: Content-settings-infrastructure.patch
